WEBVTT

00:15.320 --> 00:20.960
Autumn of the 24th year of Yuankang Prince of Jin Sikong Yao ascended the throne as emperor.

00:21.040 --> 00:26.320
Posthumously honored late emperor Sikong Jing as Xuan Yuan Emperor enfeoffed Sikong Sheng as crown prince.

00:26.640 --> 00:31.880
Posthumously honored Lady Xie as Virtuous and Cultured Empress enfeoffed Chen family's eldest daughter as consort.

00:31.960 --> 00:35.400
Rank second to the empress harmonious in the palace.

00:56.440 --> 00:57.880
I, Sikong Yao.

00:58.600 --> 01:00.933
Kneel and report to ancestors and heaven.

01:01.800 --> 01:06.440
Since after the Jianping rebellion the Wuzhao invaded.

01:06.520 --> 01:12.280
Disrupted our land I, being of Xuan's bloodline should bear the ancestral state.

01:12.400 --> 01:14.520
And care for the people.

01:15.680 --> 01:21.520
Thus defeated Shilang at Yiyang recovered the homeland in the north old people.

01:21.600 --> 01:27.520
All wept saying never thought to see the imperial army again today.

01:27.720 --> 01:30.200
After the court bred traitors.

01:30.960 --> 01:36.440
Acting perversely Yao following ancestral teachings raised troops in anger.

01:36.520 --> 01:40.520
To seek state stability now.

01:40.600 --> 01:45.880
Above, for heaven and earth's will below, for the people's support.

01:46.640 --> 01:51.600
Set altar to worship heaven announce to all under heaven inherit the great succession.

01:51.840 --> 01:55.400
Change era name longwu.

01:59.000 --> 02:01.880
Long live Your Majesty.

02:17.400 --> 02:22.640
Reward Xie Jian'an authority commands respect merit surpasses all ministers.

02:22.840 --> 02:27.600
Promote to Minister over the Masses enfeoff as Duke of Qing appoint as Chancellor.

02:27.880 --> 02:33.280
Command Six Ministries and Nine Courts record Secretariat affairs govern Jingzhou.

02:34.600 --> 02:40.560
Zu Yue loyal and humble brave and resolute promote to General of Agile Cavalry.

02:40.640 --> 02:46.000
Enfeoff as Marquis of Wuwu govern Dingzhou command all military affairs in the north.

02:46.080 --> 02:51.800
Xie Xuan outmaneuvers enemies skilled in both civil and military enfeoff as Marquis of Yongning.

02:51.880 --> 02:56.920
Appoint as Secretariat Gentleman concurrently Grand Tutor to the Crown Prince hold rank of Grandee of the Palace.

02:57.000 --> 03:01.520
Grant gold seal and purple ribbon zhu Yuanzhi steady and strategic.

03:01.600 --> 03:06.400
Brave and decisive enfeoff as General Who Guards the North appoint as Grand Commandant.

03:06.520 --> 03:11.360
Govern Qing, Yan, Ping, and Liang prefectures strike first to gain advantage posthumously honor.

03:11.440 --> 03:17.120
Late Great General Zu Kun as Loyal and Martial Guardian Duke to be enshrined in the ancestral temple.

03:17.200 --> 03:21.680
Build temple and establish worship posthumously honor late Colonel Director of Retainers Chu Huan.

03:21.760 --> 03:26.360
As Marquis of Dingxiang His son Chu Meng appoint as Colonel of the Feathered Forest.

03:26.440 --> 03:30.560
Command capital guard inherit title for three generations posthumously honor.

03:30.640 --> 03:35.760
Late Liu Dadao as Marquis of Wuyi grant Liu Nian as Zhaoyi.

03:35.840 --> 03:41.680
Enter the empress's quarters posthumously honor late Director of the Imperial Academy Yugong as Grand Preceptor.

03:41.760 --> 03:44.880
His disciple Wang Ming promoted to Censor-in-Chief.

03:45.720 --> 03:51.680
Qiu Sheng enfeoffed as Count of Yunxian grant one thousand bolts of silk command Beishuo Army as Major.

03:51.760 --> 03:55.800
Qi Jiu and Lin Shu appointed as Left and Right Guard Colonels.

03:56.000 --> 04:00.240
Each granted bright armor and ring-pommel sword guard the palace.

04:00.600 --> 04:05.520
Posthumously honor late Vice Minister of Revenue Cao Biaozhi as Marquis of Nanxiang, Cultured and Loyal.

04:05.600 --> 04:09.520
Announce far and wide let all know let those in charge implement.

04:09.680 --> 04:13.200
Jiazi day, October of the 24th year of Yuankang.

